  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n9 ∶ 79 ∶∶ 11 ∶ 119 ∶∶ 7 ∶ ?\n\n**Logic:** Second no. = [(First no.)² - 2]\n\n9 : 79 →\n\n⇒ [(9)² - 2]\n\n⇒ (81 - 2) = 79\n\n11 : 119 →\n\n⇒ [(11)2 - 2]\n\n⇒ (121 - 2) = 119\n\nSimilarly, for '7 : ?' →\n\n⇒ [(7)2 - 2]\n\n⇒ (49 - 2) = 47\n\nHere, **'7 : 47'** is the correct pair.\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option (3)\".\n\n57:T7bf,\n<",
